@HOST = http://localhost
@ACCESS_TOKEN = CHANGEME
@BRAND_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@USER_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@WALLET_ID = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

# =============================================
# Checkout completo (orquestado)
# Flujo: pago → suscripción → factura → DIAN → roles
# =============================================

# NOTA (alta de plan): en `plan_purchase` el precio se resuelve por `brand.country`
# contra el catálogo de backend-roles y la moneda es un dato DERIVADO de la fila de
# precio (o de la fila negociada, en enterprise): `currency` se IGNORA y por eso no
# aparece en estos ejemplos. `brandId` debe ser un UUID o la request se rechaza con
# 400 INVALID_BRAND_ID, y si se paga con wallet, la wallet tiene que estar en la
# moneda resuelta o responde 422 WALLET_CURRENCY_MISMATCH.
### Comprar plan Pro con wallet interna
POST {{HOST}}/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "plan_purchase",
  "provider": "wallet",
  "planSlug": "pro",
  "walletId": "{{WALLET_ID}}"
}

### Comprar plan Starter con Stripe (redirige a checkout)
POST {{HOST}}/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "plan_purchase",
  "provider": "stripe",
  "planSlug": "starter",
  "successUrl": "https://app.cubiko.dev/payment/success",
  "cancelUrl": "https://app.cubiko.dev/payment/cancel"
}

### Comprar plan con MercadoPago
POST {{HOST}}/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "plan_purchase",
  "provider": "mercadopago",
  "planSlug": "pro"
}

### Comprar plan con Dropi
POST {{HOST}}/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "plan_purchase",
  "provider": "dropi",
  "planSlug": "starter"
}

### Recargar wallet interna con Stripe
POST {{HOST}}/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "wallet_recharge",
  "provider": "stripe",
  "amount": 100000,
  "currency": "COP",
  "walletId": "{{WALLET_ID}}",
  "successUrl": "https://app.cubiko.dev/wallet/success",
  "cancelUrl": "https://app.cubiko.dev/wallet/cancel"
}

### Pago de servicio con wallet interna
POST {{HOST}}/checkout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": "{{BRAND_ID}}",
  "userId": "{{USER_ID}}",
  "purpose": "service_payment",
  "provider": "wallet",
  "amount": 50000,
  "currency": "COP",
  "walletId": "{{WALLET_ID}}"
}
